ty target as of December 31, 2030;\n\n\n               o    if that target is not achieved, a step-up mechanism will be applied, increasing the rate by\n                    25 bps as of the first interest period subsequent to the publication of the report issued by\n                    a third-party expert charged with validating the methodology for measuring CO2 emissions\n                    applied by the Group\n\n\nLending Operations\n\n\nDuring the reporting year the Company has resolved to enter as lender into several new intercompany\nfinancial agreements to support mainly the growth of the investments in the renewable energy sector.\n\nPlease see a disclosure of long-term and short-term financial instruments granted to Enel Group Companies\nin the notes 6 and 9 of the financial statements.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                                                                                                                                    5\n"}
